        "title": "Pharmacology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nAXIS 1: SITE OF ACTION\n  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Extracellular:  Receptors (GPCR, ligand-gated ions)         │\n  │ Cell surface:   Enzymes, transporters, growth factor Rs     │\n  │ Intracellular:  Nuclear receptors, intracellular enzymes    │\n  │ Nucleic acid:   DNA intercalation, RNA-targeting            │\n  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "00-OVERVIEW.md#007",
      "path": [
        "00-OVERVIEW.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:pharmacology:00-overview, git-history:pharmacology:00-overview]",
