        "title": "Pharmacology - Landscape and Taxonomy",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "AXIS 3: REVERSIBILITY\n  Reversible:   Drug-receptor complex dissociates; equilibrium dynamics\n  Irreversible: Covalent bond; effect lasts until new protein synthesized"
    },
